        "DefaultText": "<b>Preparation:</b> Boil clean water in a cooking pot, then simmer 2 Cinchona Bark in it for an hour.\n\n<b>Benefits:</b> Each dose lowers Swamp Fever by 1 but adds Nausea."
    },
